<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S = 28.82 %		     C/S = 11.86 %</p>
<p>	    O/N = 38.15 %		     O/N =  6.35 %</p>
<p>	    T/N =  3.81 %		     T/N = 24.15 %</p>
<p>		   March 31, 1997		    March  27, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  5.43 %     1 month forward =  4.74 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.44 %     2 month forward =  5.59 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.67 %     3 month forward =  5.99 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  6.70 %     4 month forward =  6.27 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  6.78 %     5 month forward =  6.51 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  6.74 %     6 month forward =  6.69 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
